## What we measured

After moving our post pages to islands, JavaScript on a typical article dropped from 182 kB to 9 kB.

{% gallery images=[{src: "/images/gallery/lighthouse-before.png", alt: "Lighthouse score 61 before", caption: "Before: 61"}, {src: "/images/gallery/lighthouse-after.png", alt: "Lighthouse score 98 after", caption: "After: 98"}] columns="2" /%}

